  <span class="part-tag" id="part1">Part I · Foundations of Information Dynamics</span>
  <h2>1. Information Dynamics &amp; Semantic Crystallization</h2>

  <p>Classical information theory (Shannon, 1948) measures the static capacity of a fixed communication channel. Classical machine learning fits static parameters $\theta$ by minimizing an empirical loss over an immutable training set. Neither framework captures how real intelligent systems actually work: in nature and in mathematics, information is not a passive payload sitting in a buffer — <strong>information acts</strong>, evolves lawfully through local interactions, couples distinct systems via mutual information, and condenses into permanent, reusable structural invariants.</p>

  <p><strong>Information dynamics</strong> is the exact mathematical theory of how structured information evolves, flows, couples, and crystallizes across interaction networks. Its primitive state is not a point estimate or a probability vector, but the <strong>observation fiber</strong> of an interaction history $h \in H$ under an observation map $o : H \to O$ (<code>lib/observation.hypercubical</code>, <code>lib/fiber.hypercubical</code>):</p>

  <div class="eq-box">
    $$\mathrm{Fib}_o(y) \;=\; \sum_{h : H} \big(o(h) \equiv y\big), \qquad H \;\simeq\; \sum_{y : O} \mathrm{Fib}_o(y)$$
  </div>

  <p>Knowledge is literally the <em>lack of ignorance</em> (Greek <em>a-lētheia</em>, un-concealment): a reading $y = o(h)$ eliminates every world-history incompatible with $y$ without fabricating a single unverified bit inside $\mathrm{Fib}_o(y)$. From this single geometric object, every quantity of information theory emerges directly with zero external probability axioms:</p>

  <ul>
    <li><strong>Residual Epistemic Entropy (Ignorance):</strong> The uncertainty remaining after reading $y$ is the log-measure of the surviving fiber:
      $$H(H \mid O = y) \;=\; \log_2 \big|\mathrm{Fib}_o(y)\big|$$
      When $|\mathrm{Fib}_o(y)| = 1$ (a contractible singleton, <code>sing-contr</code>), ignorance vanishes ($H = 0$) and the state is uniquely determined.</li>
    <li><strong>Mutual Information as Fiber Contraction:</strong> When subsystem $A$ interacts with subsystem $B$, observing $y_B = o_B(h)$ contracts the compatible fiber of $A$. The exact mutual information transmitted by the interaction is the log-ratio of fiber volumes before and after coupling:
      $$I(A;\, B \mid c) \;=\; \log_2 \frac{\big|\mathrm{Fib}_{o_A}(y_A)\big|}{\big|\mathrm{Fib}_{(o_A, o_B)}(y_A, y_B)\big|} \;=\; H(A \mid c) - H(A \mid B, c) \;\ge\; 0$$
      Zero mutual information means the two fibers factor independently; maximal mutual information means $B$'s state determines $A$'s fiber constructively.</li>
    <li><strong>Lawful Information Flow &amp; the Data Processing Inequality:</strong> Any pure local post-processing $g : O' \to O$ factoring $o = g \circ o'$ can only <em>merge</em> fibers ($|\mathrm{Fib}_{g \circ o'}(g(y'))| \ge |\mathrm{Fib}_{o'}(y')|$), never shrink them. Conversely, every claim warranted by a coarser reading remains warranted under every refinement — proved directly as a two-line program <code>warrants-refine</code> in <code>lib/observation.hypercubical</code>:
      $$\mathrm{Warrants}(g \circ o',\, g(y'),\, P) \;\longrightarrow\; \mathrm{Warrants}(o',\, y',\, P)$$</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="thm-box">
    <div class="thm-head"><span>Principle · Semantic Crystallization</span><span>lib/compress.hypercubical · lib/optimality.hypercubical</span></div>
    <p style="margin:0"><strong>Semantic crystallization</strong> is the phase transition in information dynamics where high-entropy, disordered interaction trajectories condense into rigid, low-entropy, content-addressed <strong>equivalence classes, invariants, and proof-carrying structures</strong>. Just as a physical crystal locks thermal agitation into a symmetric lattice that transmits mechanical force without dissipation, semantic crystallization locks raw observation histories into canonical cubical cells (<code>Path</code>, <code>ua</code>, SOS identities, exact context-fiber tables) that transmit mathematical truth across arbitrary composition with <strong>zero drift and zero hallucination</strong>.</p>
  </div>

  <p>Before crystallization, an intelligent system must carry the full raw history $R_{&lt;t}$ of micro-events. Once it discovers an exact structural law — a conservation invariant (<code>cr-move-total</code>), a Lyapunov SOS identity (<code>two-learner-asym-sos-id</code>), a group symmetry (<code>GroupAction</code>), or a univalent equivalence $e : A \simeq B$ — an infinite family of micro-trajectories collapses into a single $O(1)$ SHA-256 content-addressed crystal in <code>store/</code>, compressing description length down to the irreducible Shannon-rate bound (<code>lib/optimality.hypercubical</code>).</p>

